# <%= it.project.name %>

<%= it.project.description %>

<%= it.d("Application React générée par prepwork " + it.toolVersion + ". Les conventions destinées à l'agent sont dans `CLAUDE.md` et `.claude/skills/` ; ce README s'adresse aux humains et appartient à l'équipe.", "React application generated by prepwork " + it.toolVersion + ". Conventions for the agent live in `CLAUDE.md` and `.claude/skills/`; this README is for humans and belongs to the team.") %>

## <%= it.d('Prérequis', 'Prerequisites') %>

- Node <%= it.stack.node %> <%= it.d('et pnpm (`corepack enable pnpm`)', 'and pnpm (`corepack enable pnpm`)') %>
- <%= it.d("gitleaks : le hook `pre-commit` refuse tout commit tant qu'il n'est pas installé (https://github.com/gitleaks/gitleaks#installing)", 'gitleaks: the `pre-commit` hook rejects every commit until it is installed (https://github.com/gitleaks/gitleaks#installing)') %>
<% if (it.options.docker) { -%>
- <%= it.d("Docker, pour construire l'image de production", 'Docker, to build the production image') %>
<% } -%>
<% if (it.options.e2e) { -%>
- <%= it.d("Les navigateurs Playwright : `pnpm exec playwright install chromium`", 'The Playwright browsers: `pnpm exec playwright install chromium`') %>
<% } -%>

## <%= it.d('Démarrer', 'Getting started') %>

```sh
cp .env.example .env
git config core.hooksPath .githooks
pnpm install
pnpm dev
```

## <%= it.d('Commandes', 'Commands') %>

| <%= it.d('Commande', 'Command') %> | <%= it.d('Ce qu\'elle fait', 'What it does') %> |
|---|---|
<% Object.entries(it.npm.scripts).forEach(function (entry) { -%>
| `pnpm <%= entry[0] %>` | `<%= entry[1] %>` |
<% }) -%>

## <%= it.d('Structure', 'Structure') %>

| <%= it.d('Chemin', 'Path') %> | <%= it.d('Rôle', 'Purpose') %> |
|---|---|
<% it.layers.forEach(function (layer) { -%>
| `<%= layer.path %>` | <%= it.d('couche `' + layer.id + '` — ', 'layer `' + layer.id + '` — ') %><%= layer.mayDependOn.length > 0 ? it.d('dépend de ', 'depends on ') + layer.mayDependOn.join(', ') : it.d('ne dépend de rien', 'depends on nothing') %> |
<% }) -%>
| `src/shared/styles/tokens.css` | <%= it.d("Contrat visuel — appartient à l'équipe", 'Visual contract — team-owned') %> |
| `src/shared/ui/` | <%= it.d("Kit d'interface copié dans le dépôt — appartient à l'équipe", 'Interface kit copied into the repository — team-owned') %> |
| `docs/adr/` | <%= it.d("Décisions d'architecture — appartient à l'équipe", 'Architecture decision records — team-owned') %> |
| `.scaffold/manifest.json` | <%= it.d('Fichiers générés et leurs empreintes', 'Generated files and their hashes') %> |

## <%= it.d('Mettre à jour les fichiers générés', 'Updating generated files') %>

<%= it.d("Modifier `scaffold.yaml`, puis lancer `prepwork sync`. Un fichier généré que l'équipe a modifié est signalé, jamais écrasé.", 'Edit `scaffold.yaml`, then run `prepwork sync`. A generated file the team has modified is reported, never overwritten.') %>
